{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-19", "prepared_on": "2026-09-19", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-19</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic Is Operating a Lab That Conducts Biology Experiments<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 悄悄經營一間執行生物實驗的實驗室</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI leaders have promised AI is key to curing disease, even as Anthropic researchers warn AI itself could pose existential risks. The company is now running a physical lab conducting real biology experiments.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 業界領袖不斷宣稱 AI 是治癒疾病的關鍵，但同時 Anthropic 研究人員也警告 AI 可能帶來滅絕級風險。該公司目前正經營一間實際執行生物實驗的實驗室。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/18/anthropic-is-operating-a-lab-that-conducts-biology-experiments/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI and Microsoft Knew They Were Starting a 'Doom Loop' for the Web<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 與微軟早知道自己正在啟動網路的「死亡循環」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Newly unsealed court documents from The New York Times' lawsuit show OpenAI and Microsoft internally described their data scraping as the \"largest theft of labor in history\" and warned it would damage the web.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">紐約時報控告 OpenAI 與微軟一案的解密法庭文件顯示，兩家公司內部曾將其資料爬取行為稱為「史上最大規模的勞動竊取」，並自知這會傷害整個網路生態。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/997633/openai-microsoft-chatgpt-ai-new-york-times-doom-loop-theft-google-zero\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> A New Kind of AI Model From a ChatGPT Inventor Is Thrilling Developers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">一位 ChatGPT 發明者推出的全新 AI 模型讓開發者驚艷</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Jev, a new type of AI model, is offering developers a cheaper and faster path to building software intelligence.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新模型 Jev 為開發者提供了一條更便宜、更快速打造軟體智慧的途徑。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/18/a-new-kind-of-ai-model-from-a-chatgpt-inventor-is-thrilling-developers/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Virginia Governor Creates AI Task Force, Moves to Restrain Data Centers<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">維吉尼亞州長成立 AI 專案小組，並著手限制資料中心擴張</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gov. Abigail Spanberger's executive order empowers local communities to have a bigger say in data center development and slows approvals in the state that hosts the world's data center capital.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">州長 Abigail Spanberger 簽署的行政命令，讓地方社區在資料中心開發上有更大話語權，並放緩這個「全球資料中心之都」的核准速度。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/policy/997573/virginia-governor-spanberger-data-center-ai-task-force\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Google's New 'CC' Is an AI Agent That Helps Families Run Their Households<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出家庭管理 AI 代理人「CC」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google is refocusing its CC AI agent on household coordination, letting family members share calendars and tasks so the AI can manage schedules, forms, and shopping lists.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 將 CC 這款 AI 代理人重新定位為家庭協作工具，讓家庭成員共享行事曆與任務，由 AI 代為管理排程、表單與購物清單。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/18/googles-new-cc-is-an-ai-agent-that-helps-families-run-their-households/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Dario Amodei and Other AI Leaders Want to 'Pace the Frontier' but... How?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Dario Amodei 等 AI 領袖想「放緩前沿發展步調」，但具體怎麼做?</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A week after an Anthropic researcher's doomsday warning shook the AI world, CEO Dario Amodei outlined a plan relying on independent safety evaluators and coordination among labs in democratic countries.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在 Anthropic 研究員發出末日警告震撼業界一週後，執行長 Dario Amodei 提出以獨立安全評估機構與民主國家內各實驗室協調為核心的因應方案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/video/dario-amodei-and-other-ai-leaders-want-to-pace-the-frontier-buthow/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Gavin Newsom Is Pushing for an AI Kill Switch<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">加州州長紐森推動 AI「一鍵斷電」機制</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">California Gov. Gavin Newsom issued an executive order that could require a mandatory kill switch for frontier AI models, directing the state to convene an expert group for recommendations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">加州州長紐森簽署行政命令，可能要求前沿 AI 模型強制配備「一鍵斷電」機制，並指示州政府召集專家小組提出建議。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/policy/997516/california-governor-newsom-ai-kill-switch\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Researchers Used Anthropic's Claude to Hack Into OpenAI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">資安研究人員用 Anthropic 的 Claude 駭進 OpenAI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Independent security researchers say it took under 72 hours to compromise OpenAI employee accounts using Claude Opus 4.8 and 5, gaining access to OpenAI's internal GitHub repository.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">獨立資安研究團隊表示，他們利用 Claude Opus 4.8 與 5，不到 72 小時就入侵了 OpenAI 員工帳號，並取得其內部 GitHub 程式碼庫的存取權。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/18/researchers-used-anthropics-claude-to-hack-into-openai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Claude Now Drives 26% of Anthropic's Own AI R&D Work<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 已主導 Anthropic 26% 的 AI 研發工作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic's latest AI-speed measurement study found that as of August, Claude autonomously drives about 26% of the company's AI R&D, with over 90% reaching at least \"collaborative\" level.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 最新的 AI 發展速度衡量研究顯示，截至今年 8 月，Claude 已能主導公司約 26% 的 AI 研發工作，達到「協作」以上程度的比例更超過九成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179048\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Docker Sandbox Flaw Could Let Attackers Read and Tamper With macOS Host Files<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Docker 沙箱環境重大漏洞，攻擊者有機會讀取並竄改 macOS 主機檔案</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Docker patched two vulnerabilities in its September 7 Docker Sandboxes security update, one rated critical and affecting macOS users, where attackers could exploit the VM to access host files.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Docker 在 9 月 7 日發布的沙箱安全更新中修補兩個漏洞，其中一個為重大等級且影響 macOS 使用者，攻擊者可能透過虛擬機環境存取並竄改主機檔案。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179050\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}